# The one required secret: the three functions and the eval all call OpenAI with it.
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-proj-...

# Optional overrides. Commented out, so these are also the defaults the site runs.
# CHAT_MODEL=gpt-5-mini     the character's turns, netlify/functions/chat.ts
# CREATE_MODEL=gpt-5-mini   prose to character sheet, netlify/functions/create.ts
# TTS_MODEL=tts-1           the character's voice, netlify/functions/tts.ts
# PLAYER_MODEL=gpt-5-mini   the model under test in eval/pressure.ts

# URL and DEPLOY_PRIME_URL gate the functions to the site's own origin. Netlify sets
# both; nothing to put here, and localhost is allowed so `netlify dev` works.
